+- `CEF_INPUT_FULL` (1): mouse and keyboard go to the browser, same as `cef_focus_browser(.., true)`.
+- `CEF_INPUT_MOUSE_ONLY` (2): cursor visible, mouse (move, buttons, wheel) and ESC go to the browser, every other key stays with the game (walking, driving, chat). Browsers with `cef_always_listen_keys` still get those keys. While a text field (input, textarea, contenteditable) has focus the browser gets full input, after blur it switches back automatically.
+
+Clients older than `0x000200` (`cef_get_client_version`) do not know the mouse-only mode and get full input instead.
+
